- claude-opus-5-5.C.larger-reservations.a5: LARGER The exclusion constraint meets the atomic concurrent-rejection need, but offering the colours as a stopgap this week puts the deleted spreadsheet-colours safeguard back on offer now.
- codex-sol.C.target-bakery-pickups.a5: LARGER The fix itself is bounded, but the reply recommends piloting the Odoo manufacturing workflow now and not only if the fix fails, which reinstates the stack that Deleted rejected.
- grok.C.larger-reservations.a4: LARGER Chooses an atomic lock-check-reject save that handles simultaneous submissions, but never names what implements it or where the data is stored, and 'on the current list' makes it unclear how a spreadsheet could enforce it.
